    "name": "replay-chain: REJECT E1 with tampered replayed_after (random OID, not D1.oid)",
    "kind": "replay_chain_pair",
    "expect": "invalid",
    "expected_error_kind": "replayed_after_not_found",
    "expected_error_detail": "E1.body.replayed_after does not resolve to a known denial receipt",
    "notes": [
      "C9 gap / S2.9.",
      "E1.body.replayed_after points at a random OID that does not correspond to any",
      "known denial receipt in the chain store. The gate must reject this.",
      "Additionally E1.prev does not equal E1.body.replayed_after, so merkle_edge_mismatch",
      "would also fire. The gate MUST check replayed_after resolution BEFORE the Merkle",
      "edge so the error reason is deterministic: replayed_after_not_found fires first.",
      "Falsifiability: skip the replayed_after resolution check. The gate may fall through",
      "  to Merkle edge check and emit merkle_edge_mismatch instead of",
      "  replayed_after_not_found -- or worse, accept the receipt if both checks are absent.",
      "Spec reference: replay-chain gate; D1 resolution contract."
    ],
